Package: dev.rtrdd.ipatool
Name: ipatool
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Priority: optional
Section: Utilities
Maintainer: aay <275768457+aayy-dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: Majd Alfhaily
Homepage: https://github.com/aayy-dev/ipatool
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
Description: Search for and download apps from the App Store
 Command line tool that searches the App Store for iOS, iPadOS, tvOS,
 watchOS, visionOS and macOS apps, and downloads their .ipa or .pkg
 packages with your Apple ID. aay's fork of majd/ipatool, patched to run
 the App Store signing emulator (JIT) on jailbroken iOS, including iOS 26.
